Third-party components
======================

The shipped programs (ContextCompanion.Core, ContextCompanion.App and the
`ccomp` tool) use only the .NET 10 runtime and the Windows Desktop runtime
(WPF, and Windows Forms for the tray icon), both MIT licensed by the .NET
Foundation and Microsoft. They take no other package dependencies.

The test project (tests/ContextCompanion.Core.Tests) uses the following
packages at build and test time only; none of them is shipped:

